      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARA'S MILLY (1) comes here following a placing in solid time (21.73) over 380m at this track when beaten a nose in a Grade 5. Has the ability and expected to go close again. HARPER SPILLER (8) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by at this track in a handy 21.96. Outside box to overcome but goes well over this trip. Will go close again if runs up to latest. FEDERAL VOODOO (7) was impressive last start despite finishing second, recording a blistering 21.76 to place behind Kramer and clocking a new PB this course and distance. Rates a leading chance if runs up to latest. POPULAR MONSTER (2) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
